FADE IN:

INT. KITCHEN - MORNING

A small kitchen. Sunlight. **Bold action**, *italic action*, _underlined action_ and ***bold italic***.

MARIA
(quietly)
Did you see the *letter*?

JONAS
Which **letter**?

MARIA
The one on the table.

JONAS ^
Oh. That one.

