> THE END OF THE BEGINNING <

EXT. GARDEN - CONTINUOUS

Maria steps outside. The door bangs shut behind her.

MARIA (V.O.)
Some things you only say outside.

CUT TO:

INT. KITCHEN - LATER

Jonas alone, holding the letter.

JONAS
(reading)
"Dear Jonas..."

FADE OUT.
